sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Producer
  participant AU as Authority
  participant K as Keying
  participant C as Correlation
  participant F as Freshness
  participant O as Operator
  participant J as Journal
  P->>AU: packet
  AU->>K: allowed on this topic
  K->>C: key and generation set
  C->>F: cid, parent_cid chained
  F->>O: age vs TTL passes
  F-->>P: refused, quoted numbers
  O->>J: result envelope appended
